    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but that's the thing... there is no dust. there's nothing left to build with. when i look at the math of it, the energy i put in vs the zero i got back, it's just a bad equation. i feel like i'm just wasting more energy by even trying to stay upright. it feels like the more i struggle, the faster the decay happens. it's like the system is just trying to correct itself by erasing me.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
